Y a" strength needs an unwritten a-uniformity argument), and St 6.2 (the "in particular" clause needs an H ∈ T_a⁺ hypothesis). A recurring uncatalogued slip family — Not 3.13's p_F/d_F must read p_{f−a,F}/d_{f−a,F} — drives the St 3.13 erratum and riders on Not 3.14, St 3.14, St 3.15 (hypothesis), and St 3.16; the campaign already computes with the corrected reading throughout. Three filing fixes are owed independently of new numbering: SHEET6-H3.md §2a (St 3.12) and SHEET6-A2P-REVIEW.md (St 3.18) present silently corrected text as "verbatim" quotes, and SHEET6-A3L1-REVIEW.md quotes Prop 5.3(ii)'s inverted ratio unflagged.
