xmodel/websweep-0823.log:6362:-      "scope": "Starting from the exact D13/MW4 frame of EC-K3-H3-Q8-QQ-D13, eleven stored primitive integral U-neighbours with q-sequence (24,6,8,4,4,4,4,4,4,4,6) give D12/MW5, A11/MW6, 2A5/MW7, 3A3/MW8, A3+2A2/MW10, 5A1/MW12, 4A1/MW13, 3A1/MW14, 2A1/MW15, A1/MW16, and finally a rootless MW17 frame. Every factor presentation has old-fibre degree two. Independent reconstruction from the pinned witnesses checks every child Gram matrix and a determinant-one composite transport. Exact chamber checkers prove all eleven selected classes nef using finite-component degrees, full-frame closest-vector calculations, and the degree-two bisection parity identity. The final q6 witness comes from a bounded search, but the displayed witness, child, and nefness are exact; no exhaustive q4 or global minimal-q claim is made. This certifies the complete lattice/chamber chain only. The eleven equation-level characteristic-zero pencils after D13/MW4, transported sections, and specialization to curve 273 remain open.",
