xmodel/max12-812-order2-square-d1-unitload-contact-ladder-composition-hostile-review-grok-20260826.md:139:Relative successor gaps at `d=1` are `C2: 1`, `A2: 3`, `RC: 1+s`, `R3: a+3s-1`, `RA2: a+s+1`, `A3: a+4`. All are strictly positive for `a>=2`, `s>=0`. `RC` meets the next grade only for `s=0`. `R3` meets the next grade only at `(a,c,r)=(2,3,2)`. Unique minimality of `AC` itself is never lost on this cell.
